## 🏗️ Project Architecture

1. Data Collection – Collect historical financial market data.
2. Data Preprocessing – Clean and organize raw market data.
3. Feature Engineering – Generate analytical features from historical prices.
4. Machine Learning – Apply classification and anomaly detection algorithms.
5. Backend Processing – Process data and provide API responses.
6. Dashboard – Display market information and analytical results.

