## ⚠️ Important Limitations

- NSE equity analysis currently uses historical data.
- The available dataset has insufficient trading sessions for valid rolling indicators and next-day labels.
- NSE model training and performance evaluation must wait until sufficient valid historical data is available.
- No NSE live market connectivity is currently claimed.
- Automated trading and paper trading are future development stages.

